ui.info.cook.0.name = Introduction
ui.info.cook.0 = The Waiter is part of the food production of your colony. The Waiter supplies all your citizens with food and will cook meat and potatoes, as well as other cooked food that only needs a furnace.\n When a citizen gets hungry, they will go to the Cook to get something to eat.
ui.info.cook.1.name = FAQ
ui.info.cook.1 = Now let's cover some frequently asked questions:\n\n Q 1. The Waiter is asking for items that are already cooked, is this normal?\n   A 1. You can provide pre-cooked items for the waiter to distribute to your citizens.
ui.info.cook.2.name = Leveling
ui.info.cook.2 = As all workers do, the Waiter levels up while working.\n At higher levels, a Waiter's speed increases. The higher their hut level and Intelligence skill, the quicker they level up. \n However, their level is capped by the level of their home. Thus, if they are unhappy with their living conditions, they will stop leveling until you provide them with better housing.
